sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Angular SPA)
    participant C as AuthController (Spring Boot)
    participant S as AuthService (Java)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Docker)

    U->>C: POST /api/login {user, pass}
    C->>S: validateCredentials(dto)
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>S: UserData / Null
    S-->>C: JWT Token / Exception
    C-->>U: 200 OK {token} / 401 Unauthorized